{
  "_doc": "Editable risk rules. Score 0-2 green, 3-5 yellow, 6+ red. A rule with hard_red=true makes a post red at once. category 'scam' rules are softened (not hard red, weight x0.4) when the post is clearly a warning/awareness post; category 'content' rules are never softened. Patterns are JS regex source, matched case-insensitively with the unicode flag. Lao strings need native review (REVIEW-LO).",
